ent-Lighter = 基本款打火機 | basic lighter
    .desc = 一個簡單的塑膠打火機。 | A simple plastic cigarette lighter.
ent-CheapLighter = 便宜的打火機 | cheap lighter
    .desc = 一款危險又便宜的塑膠打火機。別燒到自己的拇指喔！ | A dangerously inexpensive plastic lighter. Don't burn your thumb!
ent-DiscountDanLighter = 「折扣丹」的打火機 | Discount Dan's lighter
    .desc = 有史以來最差的打火機。打火機燃燒是不可避免的，請勿在點燃狀態下加燃料。 | The worst lighter ever produced. Lighter burn is inevitable, do not refuel while lit.
ent-BaseBrandedLighter = { ent-SolutionToolWelderMini }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionToolWelderMini.desc }
ent-FlippoLighter = flippo 打火機 | flippo lighter
    .desc = 一款堅固耐用的金屬打火機，使用壽命相當長。 | A rugged metal lighter that lasts quite a while.
ent-FlippoEngravedLighter = flippo 鐫刻打火機 | flippo engraved lighter
    .desc = 一款堅固耐用的金色打火機，使用壽命相當長。上面的雕刻完全沒有任何戰術上的優勢。 | A rugged golden lighter that lasts quite a while. Engravings serve no tactical advantage whatsoever.
ent-SyndicateFlippo = 血紅翻翻鳥 | Blood-red flippo
    .desc = 打火機中的「優質」之選。不含銅。 | A 'Valid' choice in lighters. Contains no copper.
ent-CybersunFlippo = CyberSun Flippo | CyberSun Flippo
    .desc = 一款流線型的黑色與洋紅色翻蓋式打火機，印有 CyberSun Industries 的標誌與圖騰。 | A sleek black and magenta flippo lighter, bearing the logo and iconography of CyberSun Industries.
ent-InterdyneFlippo = Interdyne Flippo | Interdyne Flippo
    .desc = 一款深藍色的翻蓋打火機，飾有 Interdyne 製藥公司「Gene Clean」診所的標誌。成為自己香菸的主人。 | A deep blue flippo lighter, decorated with the logo of Interdyne Pharmaceuticals' 'Gene Clean' clinics. Become the master of your own cigarette.
ent-NanotrasenFlippo = Nanotrasen Flippo | Nanotrasen Flippo
    .desc = 一款海軍藍色的豪華「Flippo」，通常會發給忠誠的部門主管，作為加薪的替代品。以液態等離子體為動力。 | A navy blue luxury flippo, generally handed out to loyal heads of staff instead of a pay raise. Fueled with liquid plasma.
ent-CentCommFlippo = 鍍金 中央司令部 Flippo | Gilded CentComm Flippo
    .desc = 一個華麗的、飾有玉石浮雕並鍍金的翻蓋式框架，內藏一架由藍色空間驅動的噴射機。其閂扣由微型門禁讀卡器鎖定，僅對中央指揮部（CentComm）官員作出反應。這是人類已知最精美的打火機。 | An Ornate, jade embossed and gilded flippo frame containing a bluespace powered jet. The latch is secured by a miniature access reader that only responds to CentComm officials. The nicest lighter known to man.
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP
ent-SpiderclanFlippo = 蜘蛛族打火機 | Spider-Clan lighter
    .desc = 一款高科技噴射式打火機，專為即使在深空環境中也能正常運作而設計。由微型核聚變電池供電。 | A high tech jet lighter, engineered to function even in deep space. Runs on a tiny microfusion cell.
ent-WaffleCoFlippo = Waffle Co. flippo | Waffle Co. flippo
    .desc = 一款堅固耐用的量產打火機。當向上按壓時，Waffle Co. 的標誌會轉動打火輪，即使是最笨手笨腳的使用者，也能將被打火機燙傷的風險降至最低。 | A robust mass produced lighter. The Waffle Co. logo turns the spark wheel when pushed up, minimising risk of lighter burns for even the most inept user.
ent-HonkCoFlippo = Honk Co. flippo | Honk Co. flippo
    .desc = 藏在香蕉皮裡的一款搞笑打火機。由 Honk Co. 生產。 | A gag lighter hidden inside of a banana peel. Produced by Honk Co.
ent-DonkcoLighter = Donk Co. flippo | Donk Co. flippo
    .desc = 資深叛徒的首選打火機。由 Donk Co. 製造的可食用新奇打火機。 | The flippo of choice for the seasoned traitor. An edible novelty lighter made by Donk Co.
